<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-NETHERLANDS LEAD UNITED STATES 2-1 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NETHERLANDS LEAD UNITED STATES 2-1 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands took a 2-1 lead over the United States after the first reverse singles of a Fed Cup tennis World Group one first round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Dutch names first):</p>
<p>Brenda Schultz-McCarthy beat Mary Joe Fernandez 1-6 6-4 9-7</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Miriam Oremans beat Fernandez 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Schultz-McCarthy lost to Chanda Rubin 6-4 4-6 3-6</p>
</text>
